{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Has for value token DimensionRawTokens._2225 (= 200)","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","extendedModule":"OUDSThemesOrange","title":"sizeMinWidth","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B41ThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProviderC12sizeMinWidthSdvp","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sizeMinWidth","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SizeSemanticToken","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic04SizeB5Tokena","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@objc"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sizeMinWidth"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic04SizeB5Tokena","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/SizeSemanticToken","text":"SizeSemanticToken"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemequantityinputcomponenttokensprovider\/sizeminwidth"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider\/sizeMinWidth","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider/sizeMinWidth":{"kind":"symbol","title":"sizeMinWidth","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemequantityinputcomponenttokensprovider\/sizeminwidth","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token DimensionRawTokens._2225 (= 200)"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider\/sizeMinWidth","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sizeMinWidth","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic04SizeB5Tokena","text":"SizeSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of quantity input"}]},{"type":"text","text":" objects like "},{"code":"OUDSQuantityInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"code":"AllQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"code":"QuantityInputComponentTokens","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"tag inputs"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Quantity inputs"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemequantityinputcomponenttokensprovider","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","role":"collection","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Theme Orange","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Theme Orange","images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","type":"icon"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSTokensSemantic/documentation/OUDSTokensSemantic/SizeSemanticToken":{"kind":"symbol","title":"SizeSemanticToken","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SizeSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/sizesemantictoken","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Basically a size semantic token, used for width and height values, is a _ raw token,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it has the same final type, to keep grammar clean and clear with design system grammar."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/SizeSemanticToken","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SizeSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}]},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"type":"image","alt":null,"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}],"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}}}